STAFF RECOMMENDATION:  The Planning and Development Office recommends approval of Terre
Pont Final Plat, with the following condition:
1. Execution of a Development Agreement addressing the connection of Rue Terre to the southeast.

UPDATE (OCTOBER 8, 2013): At its regular meeting Monday, October 7, 2013, the Cheyenne
Planning Commission voted unanimously to recommend approval of the final plat for Terre Pont
Subdivision with the following condition:
1. Execution of a Development Agreement addressing the connection of Rue Terre to the southeast.
